  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 4.3% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $281.24B (4.3% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/08/stablecoin-growth-has-stalled-the-payments-boom-hasn-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stablecoin growth has stalled. The payments boom hasn&#x27;t</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/defi/2026-11-09-zama-spin-off-raycash-launches-confidential-stablecoin-payments-private-yield-ethereum-435909\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Zama spin-off Raycash launches confidential stablecoin payments and private yield on Ethereum</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/pnc-bank-launches-usdc-payment-pilot-coinbase?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PNC Bank tests turning USDC payments into dollar deposits</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
